WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.480
Let's see how to get started with sponsored display contextual targeting to target your ads

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:05.973
against products and categories.

00:00:05.973 --> 00:00:10.080
First, we recommend starting with 10 or more well-performing products.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.611
Then choose contextual targeting.

00:00:11.611 --> 00:00:15.440
You can add entire categories to your targeting or individual

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:15.877
products.

00:00:15.877 --> 00:00:19.376
You can add or refine our suggested categories.

00:00:19.376 --> 00:00:22.000
Search for ones yourself and include

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.931
a dynamic segment of products similar to the ones you're advertising.

00:00:25.931 --> 00:00:27.360
To target individual products,

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:35.840
use our suggestions, search, enter a list, or upload one.
